# Append-only contract/spec docs: every US-CART-* / US-CAT-* branch adds a new
# section at the end of these shared files, so parallel branches collide on the
# same trailing lines at PR/merge time. The `union` merge driver resolves such
# collisions automatically by keeping *both* sides' added lines instead of
# raising a conflict. Safe here because the changes are additive (new sections /
# new paths / new schemas), never edits to the same existing lines.
#
# After a union auto-merge, skim the merged section once: union concatenates in
# order and will NOT dedupe if two branches happen to add the *same* key — that
# case still needs a manual look. For everything else this removes the manual
# conflict resolution you kept hitting.
flows/b2c-cart-flows.md   merge=union
b2c/cart/openapi.yaml      merge=union
